      "items": [
        "SIAL forms the continental crust and floats on the denser SIMA layer, which forms the ocean beds.",
        "The abundance of Nickel and Iron in the NIFE layer is responsible for Earth's geomagnetic field.",
        "Direct questions often test the chemical formula abbreviations: SIAL (Si + Al), SIMA (Si + Mg), and NIFE (Ni + Fe)."
      ],
      "id": "85xq2b8"
